{"displayStem":"같은 감각뉴런에 약한 자극 가와 강한 자극 나를 각각 반복 없이 제시한 spike-time 자료이다. 각 창은 자극 시작 후 0–200 ms이다. 각 spike의 진폭은 약 90 mV로 같았다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C09 c09-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c09-graph\"><figure class=\"c09-panel\"><figcaption>세로 표시 하나가 활동전위 1회이며 표시 높이는 동일하다.</figcaption><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자극 뒤 시각 (ms)에 따른 조건 (0: 가, 1: 나)\"><style>text{font:17px 'Noto Sans CJK KR',sans-serif}</style><text x=\"15\" y=\"24\">조건 (0: 가, 1: 나)</text><path d=\"M65 50h20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"56\">가</text><path d=\"M190 50h20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></path><text x=\"215\" y=\"56\">나</text><path d=\"M66 78V263H431\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><path d=\"M66 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M248.5 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"248.5\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100.0</text><path d=\"M431 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"431\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200</text><path d=\"M61 263h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M61 170.5h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"175.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><path d=\"M61 78h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><polyline points=\"66,244.5 102.5,244.5 102.5,189 102.5,244.5 248.5,244.5 248.5,189 248.5,244.5 394.5,244.5 394.5,189 394.5,244.5 431,244.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"244.5\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"102.5\" cy=\"244.5\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"102.5\" cy=\"189\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"><